                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body d-flex flex-column">
                        <p class="mb-3">
                            <strong>Tienes 7 líneas disponibles para recorrer la ciudad de manera rápida y segura:</strong>
                        </p>
                        <div class="row flex-grow-1">
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                                <div class="route-item d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                                    <div class="route-circle" style="background-color: purple;">1</div>
                                    <div class="route-info">
                                        <div class="route-name">SAN SEBASTIÁN Z.1/CENTRO CÍVICO Z.1</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="route-item d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                                    <div class="route-circle" style="background-color: skyblue;">2</div>
                                    <div class="route-info">
                                        <div class="route-name">HIPÓDROMO DEL NORTE Z.2/SAN SEBASTIÁN Z.1</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="route-item d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                                    <div class="route-circle text-dark" style="background-color: yellow;">6</div>
                                    <div class="route-info">
                                        <div class="route-name">PROYECTOS Z.6/FEGUA Z.1</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="route-item d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                                    <div class="route-circle" style="background-color: green;">7</div>
                                    <div class="route-info">
                                        <div class="route-name">USAC PERIFÉRICO Z.12/LA MERCED Z.1</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                                <div class="route-item d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                                    <div class="route-circle" style="background-color: red;">12</div>
                                    <div class="route-info">
                                        <div class="route-name">CENTRO SUR/PLAZA BARRIOS Z.1</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="route-item d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                                    <div class="route-circle" style="background-color: black;">13</div>
                                    <div class="route-info">
                                        <div class="route-name">PLAZA ARGENTINA Z.13/TIPOGRAFÍA Z.1</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="route-item d-flex align-items-start gap-3">
                                    <div class="route-circle" style="background-color: blue;">18</div>
                                    <div class="route-info">
                                        <div class="route-name">ATLÁNTIDA Z.18/FEGUA Z.1</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- TuBus -->
            <div class="col-md-6 d-flex">
                <div class="card shadow-sm rounded h-100 w-100">
                    <div class="card-header text-white d-flex align-items-center" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #28a745, #5cd65c);">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-bus-front-fill me-2" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                            <path d="M4 1a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v11.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 3 0V2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1zm8 0a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v11.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-3 0V2a1 1 0 0 1 1-1z"/>
                            <path d="M0 8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3H0V8z"/>
                        </svg>
                        <h3 class="m-0 fw-bold">TuBus</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body d-flex flex-column">
                        <p class="mb-3">
                            <strong>Una ruta adicional para movilizarte en la ciudad:</strong>
                        </p>
                        <div class="flex-grow-1 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
                            <div class="route-item d-flex align-items-start gap-3 w-100">
                                <div class="route-circle text-white" style="background-color: blue;">5</div>
                                <div class="route-info">
                                    <div class="route-name">PARQUE COLÓN Z.1/PUENTE DE LA PENITENCIARIA Z.4</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

